        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Night Latch Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Night Latch Function Lever (Outside entrance by lever when latch bolt is retracted by Key)  is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>4200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200v\"><b>4200 Series Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-vertical-rod-exit-device-pdq-4200v-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-rim-exit-device-pdq-4200r-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Rim Exit Device</b></a>, \r\n Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-grade-2-surface-vertical-rod-door-panic-device-th1100edsvtbar\"><b>TH1100EDSVTBAR Surface Vertical Rod Panic Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/classroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-4-sh-08-phl\"><b>Classroom Function Lever for Panic Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/passage-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-4-sh-14-phl\"><b>Non Locking Passage Lever for Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 4-SH-09-PHL  Keyed Night Latch Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Outside entrance by lever when latch bolt is retracted by Key.  (Lever only opens door when the key is turned). Key removable only when locked (Night Latch).</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/429LPSH.pdf?v=1704262275\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 4-SH-09-PHL Installation Template & Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
